  message: "Shipped in PR #3425. Added 'When NOT to file a new tracker item' section to structural-fix-scope-expansion-protocol.md plus a cross-reference paragraph at the end of the existing Commitment Protocol section. Names three failure modes (existing-coverage check / conversation-in-progress check / property-of-existing-invariant check) that empirically produce cargo-cult filings. Default 'when in doubt use todo_hard' is retained — addition only narrows it for those three shapes. Hook summary update in .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py:PLAYBOOKS deferred (governance, separate review). Per AGENTS.md 'Creating a New Playbook' note, the playbook .md is not a governance file."  # f131
